Do not run the bundled auto-updater on startup.

SqualrEngine::initialize unconditionally calls AppUpdater::run_update,
which downloads the latest GitHub release archive on every launch and
then fails looking for a hardcoded squalr.exe. Distribution packages
must not self-update in any case.

Not upstream; the Linux path of the updater is simply unimplemented.
